      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُغُبٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغَابٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَعِيبٌ</span>; with both of which
