       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  It is also a pl. of the latter,
(L in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أسد</span>,) and of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغِبٌ</span>. (TA.)

